  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "- Complimentary, private GraytLife Rentals bonfire for you & your guests (staying in the home with you) for stays that are 5 nights or more <br><br>- 1 minute walk to the beach walkway<br><br>- Private heated saltwater pool (10ft. X 20ft) <br>*Enjoy a warm, comfortable swim any time of year! Pool heating is available for an additional $25 per night (from check in to check out).<br>**Pool heating is completely optional. Simply let us know your preference after booking your stay.<br><br>- 6 adult bikes (unisex beach cruisers)<br> <br>- Large gas grill (propane tank available but will need to be filled)<br><br>- Corn Hole<br><br>- 6 dedicated parking spots.<br><br>- ALL linens laundered upon every checkout<br><br>DETAILS: <br>This home offers 4 bedrooms, 4.5 bathrooms, a short 1 minute walk to the beach walkway and wonderful accommodations for up to 17 guests. <br><br>This beautiful home in Grayton Beach offers all the amenities you desire and plenty of room for the whole family too. The spacious interior features vaulted ceilings and a beautiful open floor plan connecting the living room to the fully-stocked kitchen. Two dining tables provide ample seating for everyone to share a meal together. The coastal, elegant décor will have you feeling relaxed the moment you step foot into Grayton Dunes! <br><br>On the first floor,<br>there is 1 Master king bedroom with a full private bath attached as well as a bedroom equipped with 2 Queen beds with a full private bath attached. <br> <br>When you arrive on the second floor, <br>there is one King bedroom with a full bath attached and a super fun & functional bunk bed room for kids or adults (can sleep 9) with a full bath attached.<br><br>Guests in this home will love the spacious front deck with lots of seating, including a table on one side and rocking chairs on the other. Enjoy a freshly prepared dinner on the large gas grill or take a stroll to enjoy the delectable bites and delicious drinks at Chiringo or Red Bar—two of Grayton Beach’s best local spots. <br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br><br>FIRST FLOOR:<br><br>- Master Bedroom: King bed, private full bath, LCD/HD flat screen TV<br>- Bedroom with 2 Queen beds, private full bath, LCD/HD flat screen TV<br><br>SECOND FLOOR:<br><br>- King Bedroom: King bed, private full bath, LCD/HD flat screen TV <br><br>- Bunk bed room: 3 sets <br> 1st set has a full size bed on the bottom, full size on the top, and trundle (sleeps 3)<br> 2nd set has a full size bed on the bottom, full size on the top, and trundle (sleeps 3)<br> 3rd set has a full size bed on the bottom, twin size on the top, and trundle (sleeps 3)<br> Private full bath<br><br>No parties allowed at this home. <br>Should there be damage from your stay, you will be held liable and will be charged for the damaged items.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
